### 6. LEDC HAL Search (vendor/sifli/chips/sf32lb52/)

**Result: No LEDC peripheral or driver exists.** A comprehensive search for `ledc` and `LEDC` (case-insensitive) across the entire `vendor/sifli/` directory tree returned **zero meaningful matches**. The SiFli sf32lb52 chip does not appear to have an LEDC (LED Control) peripheral block. PWM-based LED control is done through the GPTIM/ATIM timers via the PWM driver (`sf32lb_pwm.c`).

